dragon scales, gauntlets of power, a magic marker, and around eight
unicorn horns from hanging around dlvl 1- 7 too much. Then he
attempted to kill a priest without magic missile and died, even with
-14AC and 150 HP. Priests are glass cannons: kill them fast, or have a
moderately powerful pet (read: anything better than a large puppy, and
they're dead. Otherwise, you're dead.

